  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: '<size=20>

      - Whenever              appears, there is a chance the
      <b><color=purple>Stampede</color> Free Games</b> may be triggered.

      -
      Whenever              appears, there is a chance the <b><color=red>Gold</color>
      Free Games</b> may be triggered.

      - Whenever              appears, there
      is a chance the <b><color=green>Jackpot</color> Free Games</b> may be triggered.

      -
      If only <b><color=purple>Stampede</color> Free Games</b> is triggered in the
      spin, the <b><color=purple>Stampede</color> Free Games</b> is awarded.

      -
      If only <b><color=red>Gold</color> Free Games</b> is triggered in the spin,
      the <b><color=red>Gold</color> Free Games</b> is awarded.

      - If only
      <b><color=green>Jackpot</color> Free Games</b> is triggered in the spin, the
      <b><color=green>Jackpot</color> Free Games</b> is awarded.

      - If only
      <b><color=purple>Stampede</color> Free Games</b> and <b><color=red>Gold</color>
      Free Games</b> are triggered in the same spin, the <b><color=purple>Stampede</color>
      <color=red>Gold</color> Free Games</b> is awarded.

      - If only <b><color=purple>Stampede</color>
      Free Games</b> and <b><color=green>Jackpot</color> Free Games</b> are triggered
      in the same spin, the <b><color=purple>Stampede</color> <color=green>Jackpot</color>
      Free Games</b> is awarded.

      - If only <b><color=red>Gold</color> Free
      Games</b> and <b><color=green>Jackpot</color> Free Games</b> are triggered
      in the same spin, the <b><color=red>Gold</color> <color=green>Jackpot</color>
      Free Games</b> is awarded.

      - If <b><color=purple>Stampede</color> Free
      Games</b>, <b><color=red>Gold</color> Free Games</b> and <b><color=green>Jackpot</color>
      Free Games </b>are triggered in the same spin, the <b><color=purple>Stampede</color>
      <color=red>Gold</color> <color=green>Jackpot</color> Free Games</b> is awarded.

      </size>


